  m_Name: DadUrsaPostcard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Category: 0
  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "Little Bear\u2014\r\n\r\nGot your last letter. I wish you could see the stars
    here\u2014when the sky\u2019s clear, it feels like standing under a frozen dome
    of glass. But no Big Dipper. No Ursa Major. No me, I guess.\r\n\r\nDid you know
    \u201CAntarctica\u201D literally means the land with no bears? And the Arctic
    means land of bears. Most folks think it\u2019s about polar bears (which, yes,
    only live up north), but the name actually comes from the sky. You can\u2019t
    see the Bear constellations from down here. No Big Dipper. No Little Dipper.
    No Ursa at all.\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s strange. I grew up thinking those shapes would
    always be there, wherever I went. But here\u2014it\u2019s a sky without bears.\r\n\r\nI\u2019ll
    try to make my way north once things settle. Look for me in the stars.\r\n\r\nLove,\r\nUrsa
    Major"
